OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud tonight, but with some clear
OL,7,Fspells likely, allowing another cold
OL,8,Fnight with areas of frost developing.
OL,9,FPerhaps some spots of rain or drizzle,
OL,10,Fmainly over high ground in the west.
OL,11,FBreezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAnother cold feeling day,
OL,14,Fwith a strengthening breeze. A mixture
OL,15,Fof cloud and sunny spells, with some
OL,16,Fspells of rain or drizzle, mainly over
OL,17,Fhigh ground in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
